# STEP files only

When a part or assembly is built, the deliverable is the `.step` file. Do not also present the model.

- Do not open the CAD viewer (`cad_show` or a viewer link).
- Do not take snapshots, screenshots, or rendered pictures.
- Export the requested `.step` and give its path.
